── StreamScout & GigHunt ── Environment Variables ──

── Twitch (Free App Token) ──
TWITCH_CLIENT_ID=
TWITCH_CLIENT_SECRET=

── YouTube Data API v3 ──
YOUTUBE_API_KEY=

── Twitter / X ──
TWITTER_AUTH_TOKEN=
TWITTER_CT0=
TWITTER_USERNAME=
TWITTER_EMAIL=
TWITTER_PASSWORD=

── Reddit (Free "script" app) ──
REDDIT_CLIENT_ID=
REDDIT_CLIENT_SECRET=
REDDIT_USER_AGENT=

── Application ──
MIN_VIEWERS=1000
MIN_FOLLOWERS=100000
DORMANCY_DAYS=180
